<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - TBN 135,000 tonnes Richards Bay/Rotterdam plus Antwerp 1-15/2 low $7.00s fio scale load/30,000-35,000 shinc Bocimar.</p>
<p>Mineral Dragon - 140,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam 20/1-5/2 approx. $6.90/$7.00 fio scale load/40,000 shinc P &amp; O.</p>
<p>TBN 110,000 tonnes Baltimore/Rotterdam 15-30/1 approx. $6.50 fio 35,000 shinc/40,000 shinc Cobelfret.</p>
<p>Mount Athos - 77,000 tonnes Maracaibo/Fos 20-30/12 $11.00 fio 20,000 shinc/25,000 shinc Coe and Clerici.</p>
</text>
